Package: libepoll-shim-dev
Version: @DEB_EPOLLSHIM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libepoll-shim0 (= @DEB_EPOLLSHIM_V@)
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/jiixyj/epoll-shim
Description: Development files for epoll-shim
 A small implementation of Linux's epoll(7), timerfd, signalfd and eventfd
 APIs on top of kqueue(2). This package contains the headers (under
 include/libepoll-shim), the static library and the pkg-config file.
